<div class="hr av-2hz9w5-f0778d7ae629c094504b0f1feee84993 hr-invisible avia-builder-el-79 el_after_av_heading el_before_av_one_half"><span class="hr-inner"><span class="hr-inner-style"></span></span></div>
<div class="flex_column_table av-96t41k-466a7ca6dd727d42f15661f171e6403e sc-av_one_half av-equal-height-column-flextable"><div class="flex_column av-96t41k-466a7ca6dd727d42f15661f171e6403e av_one_half avia-builder-el-80 el_after_av_hr el_before_av_one_half first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top"><section class="av_textblock_section av-m8sx7svc-45a6cef208b063baa8b80b533f9ecfdd" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><h3><a href="about-bankole-johnson.php">Meet Professor Bankole Johnson M.D., D.SC.</a></h3>
<p>At the heart of every transformative journey at Casa Privée is the unparalleled expertise of <strong><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bankole_Johnson" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Dr. Bankole Johnson</a></strong>, a globally recognized leader in addiction medicine and neuroscience.</p>
<p>Dr. Johnson is more than a medical professional; he is a visionary combining cutting-edge research with compassionate care. With over 80 global patents, his contributions to brain science and genetics-based addiction treatments have shaped the industry.</p>
<h4>Achievements That Set Him Apart</h4>
<p>Dr. Johnson has been the recipient of multiple prestigious awards, such as the <em><strong><a href="https://www.psychiatry.org/membership/awards-leadership-opportunities/awards/fuller-award" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Solomon Carter Fuller Award</a></strong></em>, and has been <a href="https://differentbrains.org/neurodiversity-overcoming-addiction-interview-dr-bankole-johnson/" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><em><strong>featured in Emmy-winning documentaries like HBO’s Addiction</strong></em></a>. Alongside his groundbreaking works in neuroscience, Dr. Johnson authored <a href="https://a.co/d/geRR69T" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><em><strong>“Addiction Medicine: Science and Practice”</strong></em></a>, the definitive textbook on the subject.</p>
<p>With decades of research and clinical success, Dr. Johnson offers unparalleled leadership, ensuring our clients consistently achieve results far beyond traditional treatments.</p>
</div></section></div><div class="av-flex-placeholder"></div><div class="flex_column av-88z9g8-2e27219d4f3a785a7cbc3ea019c2820b av_one_half avia-builder-el-82 el_after_av_one_half el_before_av_one_full flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top"><div class="avia-image-container av-m8syfj2d-957629ff3aabc961ab9484a601fd4dbf av-styling- avia-align-center avia-builder-el-83 avia-builder-el-no-sibling" itemprop="image" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/ImageObject"><div class="avia-image-container-inner"><div class="avia-image-overlay-wrap"><img alt="Dr. Bankole Johnson, a leader in neuroscience, neuropsychiatry, and addiction medicine. Miami drug rehabiliation program for alcohol and substance abuse. Get help with drug rehab and alcohol detox in Miami." class="wp-image-1383 avia-img-lazy-loading-not-1383 avia_image" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" height="632" itemprop="thumbnailUrl" sizes="(max-width: 576px) 100vw, 576px" src="../wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Dr.-Bankole-A.-Johnson.webp" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Dr.-Bankole-A.-Johnson.webp 576w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Dr.-Bankole-A.-Johnson-273x300.webp 273w" title="Addiction Medicine" width="576"/></div></div></div></div></div><!--close column table wrapper. Autoclose: 1 --><div class="flex_column_table av-ma3go3b8-b7535cc40b044f166c0146e0c9ae3e65 sc-av_one_full av-equal-height-column-flextable"><div class="flex_column av-ma3go3b8-b7535cc40b044f166c0146e0c9ae3e65 av_one_full avia-builder-el-84 el_after_av_one_half avia-builder-el-last first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top column-top-margin"><section class="av_textblock_section av-ma3g9zsr-1290f38582799138b5d280ab778e8a6b" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><h3 style="text-align: center;">Pioneering Contributions and Leadership</h3>
<p style="text-align: center;">The impact of Dr. Bankole Johnson on addiction medicine extends far beyond the clinic, with extensive leadership and groundbreaking innovations that have shaped the field. He served as the chair of the national guidelines for the treatment of alcohol use disorder (AUD) and was a key panel member for the national guidelines addressing substance use disorders (SUD). His expertise earned the Governor’s citation in Maryland, recognizing his contributions to the state’s task force dedicated to reducing opiate and methamphetamine use.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;">His pioneering research has led to transformative treatments, including the introduction of topiramate for alcohol and cocaine addiction, a medication now widely used for these conditions. Additionally, he co-authored the world guidelines on effective detoxification strategies, providing a global framework for safe and successful treatment methods. Most notably, as the inventor of the first genetic-based treatment for alcohol use disorder, he has marked a significant breakthrough in personalized medicine. Further solidifying his legacy, Dr. Johnson founded Adial Pharmaceuticals, a NASDAQ-listed company dedicated to developing novel medicines for addiction. Under his leadership, the company continues to redefine possibilities in this vital field.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><em><strong>These contributions reflect his dedication to advancing the science and practice of addiction medicine, transforming countless lives through innovative approaches.</strong></em></p>
</div></section>
