<section class="av_toggle_section av-ma2udm4p-1623b79a089ed53b27901505b4d11bb7" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="single_toggle" data-tags="{All} " role="tablist"><p aria-controls="toggle-id-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Click to expand: Q.1. What is drug addiction?" class="toggler av-title-above" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Q.1. What is drug addiction?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Q.1. What is drug addiction?" data-fake-id="#toggle-id-1" data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Q.1. What is drug addiction?" data-title-open="" id="toggle-toggle-id-1" itemprop="name" role="tab" tabindex="0">Q.1. What is drug addiction?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="toggle-toggle-id-1" class="toggle_wrap av-title-above" id="toggle-id-1" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" role="region" tabindex="-1"><div class="toggle_content invers-color" itemprop="text"><p>Substance use disorder, commonly referred to as drug addiction, is a long-term condition characterized by the uncontrollable use of drugs despite negative impacts. It alters brain function and behavior, creating significant challenges for individuals to stop without effective intervention.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class="av_toggle_section av-ma2ufot4-476fcfcf8a97649a95b64cbfc35721a9" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="single_toggle" data-tags="{All} " role="tablist"><p aria-controls="toggle-id-2" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Click to expand: Q.2. How do I know if I need rehab for addiction?" class="toggler av-title-above" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Q.2. How do I know if I need rehab for addiction?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Q.2. How do I know if I need rehab for addiction?" data-fake-id="#toggle-id-2" data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Q.2. How do I know if I need rehab for addiction?" data-title-open="" id="toggle-toggle-id-2" itemprop="name" role="tab" tabindex="0">Q.2. How do I know if I need rehab for addiction?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="toggle-toggle-id-2" class="toggle_wrap av-title-above" id="toggle-id-2" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" role="region" tabindex="-1"><div class="toggle_content invers-color" itemprop="text"><p>A.2. Signs you may need rehab include:</p>
<ul>
<li>Difficulty controlling drug use.</li>
<li>Experiencing withdrawal symptoms when not using.</li>
<li>Neglecting responsibilities or relationships due to substance use.</li>
<li>Increased tolerance, requiring more of the drug to feel the same effects.</li>
</ul>
<p><a href="contact-us.php">Contact us today</a> to discover why we are the top VIP clinic for drug rehab Miami has available.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class="av_toggle_section av-ma2ukhnl-3df48c89699173ed27f424cb99fbf636" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="single_toggle" data-tags="{All} " role="tablist"><p aria-controls="toggle-id-3" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Click to expand: Q.3. What makes Casa Privée different from other Miami rehab centers?" class="toggler av-title-above" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Q.3. What makes Casa Privée different from other Miami rehab centers?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Q.3. What makes Casa Privée different from other Miami rehab centers?" data-fake-id="#toggle-id-3" data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Q.3. What makes Casa Privée different from other Miami rehab centers?" data-title-open="" id="toggle-toggle-id-3" itemprop="name" role="tab" tabindex="0">Q.3. What makes Casa Privée different from other Miami rehab centers?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="toggle-toggle-id-3" class="toggle_wrap av-title-above" id="toggle-id-3" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" role="region" tabindex="-1"><div class="toggle_content invers-color" itemprop="text"><p>A.3. Casa Privée offers a luxury, science-driven approach to recovery. With cutting-edge treatments like <a href="hyperbaric-oxygen-therapy-hbot.php">Hyperbaric Oxygen Therapy</a>, <a href="thetachamber.php">ThetaChamber™</a>, <a href="iv-nutrition-therapy.php">IV Treatments</a>, and <a href="neurostar-tms-therapy.php">NeuroStar TMS</a>, we focus on healing the body, mind, and spirit. Our private, exclusive setting, limited to 500 members, ensures a discreet and personalized recovery experience.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class="av_toggle_section av-ma2ummn0-4e5a379b1bf70b027d301fbe67cd079e" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="single_toggle" data-tags="{All} " role="tablist"><p aria-controls="toggle-id-4" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Click to expand: Q.4. How long does the recovery process take?" class="toggler av-title-above" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Q.4. How long does the recovery process take?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Q.4. How long does the recovery process take?" data-fake-id="#toggle-id-4" data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Q.4. How long does the recovery process take?" data-title-open="" id="toggle-toggle-id-4" itemprop="name" role="tab" tabindex="0">Q.4. How long does the recovery process take?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="toggle-toggle-id-4" class="toggle_wrap av-title-above" id="toggle-id-4" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" role="region" tabindex="-1"><div class="toggle_content invers-color" itemprop="text"><p>A.4. The recovery process varies for everyone. At Casa Privée, we offer flexible <a href="treatment-programs.php">treatment programs</a> to fit individual needs, such as our 30-day luxury inpatient program or Anti-Crave Packages lasting 4 to 24 weeks.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class="av_toggle_section av-ma2ur3qm-912cb06a42439eab403dd6b96f9f6918" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="single_toggle" data-tags="{All} " role="tablist"><p aria-controls="toggle-id-5" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Click to expand: Q.5. What amenities can I expect at Casa Privée?" class="toggler av-title-above" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Q.5. What amenities can I expect at Casa Privée?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Q.5. What amenities can I expect at Casa Privée?" data-fake-id="#toggle-id-5" data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Q.5. What amenities can I expect at Casa Privée?" data-title-open="" id="toggle-toggle-id-5" itemprop="name" role="tab" tabindex="0">Q.5. What amenities can I expect at Casa Privée?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="toggle-toggle-id-5" class="toggle_wrap av-title-above" id="toggle-id-5" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" role="region" tabindex="-1"><div class="toggle_content invers-color" itemprop="text"><p>A.5. Casa Privée offers five-star accommodations in Miami, Florida, customized nutrition plans, personal concierge services, and luxury transportation, including chauffeur-driven Bentleys or Rolls-Royces. Every detail is designed to provide comfort and ease during your recovery.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class="av_toggle_section av-ma2ur3qm-7-1df1486052b77d000c269d109a917441" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="single_toggle" data-tags="{All} " role="tablist"><p aria-controls="toggle-id-6" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Click to expand: Q.6. What role does genetic testing play in recovery?  " class="toggler av-title-above" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Q.6. What role does genetic testing play in recovery?  " data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Q.6. What role does genetic testing play in recovery?  " data-fake-id="#toggle-id-6" data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Q.6. What role does genetic testing play in recovery?  " data-title-open="" id="toggle-toggle-id-6" itemprop="name" role="tab" tabindex="0">Q.6. What role does genetic testing play in recovery?  <span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="toggle-toggle-id-6" class="toggle_wrap av-title-above" id="toggle-id-6" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" role="region" tabindex="-1"><div class="toggle_content invers-color" itemprop="text"><p>A.6. We utilize advanced <a href="unparalleled-testing.php">genetic testing</a> to identify biological vulnerabilities to alcohol or drug dependency. This allows us to tailor treatments to each client, ensuring the safest and most effective medications and dosages are applied to optimize recovery outcomes.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class="av_toggle_section av-ma2ur3qm-6-43ed114a305e11e4217168f74af11248" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="single_toggle" data-tags="{All} " role="tablist"><p aria-controls="toggle-id-7" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Click to expand: Q.7. Are abstinence-based treatments the only approach at Casa Privee?" class="toggler av-title-above" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Q.7. Are abstinence-based treatments the only approach at Casa Privee?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Q.7. Are abstinence-based treatments the only approach at Casa Privee?" data-fake-id="#toggle-id-7" data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Q.7. Are abstinence-based treatments the only approach at Casa Privee?" data-title-open="" id="toggle-toggle-id-7" itemprop="name" role="tab" tabindex="0">Q.7. Are abstinence-based treatments the only approach at Casa Privee?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="toggle-toggle-id-7" class="toggle_wrap av-title-above" id="toggle-id-7" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" role="region" tabindex="-1"><div class="toggle_content invers-color" itemprop="text"><p>A.7. No, we recognize that abstinence is not a one-size-fits-all solution. We emphasize science-based treatments, incorporating harm reduction models to accommodate the diverse needs of our clients. These approaches aim to improve quality of life and reduce risks associated with substance use while fostering long-term recovery.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class="av_toggle_section av-ma2ur3qm-5-a14e1e63b83bdce229891d48b0ece965" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="single_toggle" data-tags="{All} " role="tablist"><p aria-controls="toggle-id-8" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Click to expand: Q.8. What are ketamine-facilitated detox regimens and how do they help?" class="toggler av-title-above" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Q.8. What are ketamine-facilitated detox regimens and how do they help?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Q.8. What are ketamine-facilitated detox regimens and how do they help?" data-fake-id="#toggle-id-8" data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Q.8. What are ketamine-facilitated detox regimens and how do they help?" data-title-open="" id="toggle-toggle-id-8" itemprop="name" role="tab" tabindex="0">Q.8. What are ketamine-facilitated detox regimens and how do they help?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="toggle-toggle-id-8" class="toggle_wrap av-title-above" id="toggle-id-8" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" role="region" tabindex="-1"><div class="toggle_content invers-color" itemprop="text"><p>A.8. <a href="ketamine-iv-treatment.php">Ketamine detox regimens</a> offer a groundbreaking way to ease the transition from heavy alcohol or drug use to healthier, more normative behaviors. This innovative method can alleviate withdrawal symptoms, reduce cravings, and support emotional stability, making the detoxification process smoother and less distressing.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
